            "verseId": "1SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 2:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jakobo ariphophiya Misiri na Amisiri ariphoaonera akare enu, aho amririra Mwenyezi Mlungu naye Mwenyezi Mlungu achihuma Musa na Aruni, ambao aatuluza akare enu kula Misiri, achedzaaika phatu phapha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.4.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aamuli 4:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.13.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aamuli 13:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aamuli 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela amyala Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wao naye achiaguza na kuatiya mikononi mwa Sisera, mkpwulu wa jeshi ra Hazori, mikononi mwa Afilisti na katika mikono ya mfalume wa Moabu. Nao achipigana na akare a Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.10.10+JDG.10.11+JDG.10.12+JDG.10.13+JDG.10.14+JDG.10.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aamuli 10:10–15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao amririra Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba, ‘Hukahenda dambi, kpwa kukala hukamricha Mwenyezi Mlungu na kuahumikira Mabaali na Maashitorethi. Ela sambi huokole mikononi mwa aviha ehu, naswi hundakuhumikira.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aamuli 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.4.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aamuli 4:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.11.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aamuli 11:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 3:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu waahuma Jerubaali, Baraka, Jefutha na Samueli, achikuokolani kula mikononi mwa aviha enu a pande zosi namwi mchiishi salama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.8.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 8:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mriphomuona Nahashi, mfalume wa Aamoni analonda kupigana namwi, mwaniambira, ‘Hunalonda mfalume ahutawale,’ dzagbwe Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, ndiye mfalume wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi phahi, mfalume mriyemtsambula na kumlonda ndiye hiyu. Mwenyezi Mlungu akakuikirani mfalume, akutawaleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho mundamuogopha Mwenyezi Mlungu na kumuhumikira, kusikira sautiye na kusavundza amuriye; chisha ichikala mwimwi na mfalume anayekutawalani mundalunga Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, rindakala dzambo nono! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela msiphoitii sauti ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, mchivundza amuriye, ndipho nduni ya Mwenyezi Mlungu indakala dzulu yenu dza irivyokala dzulu ya akare enu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sambi imani muone dzambo kulu ambaro Mwenyezi Mlungu andarihenda mbere zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze! Hino si kazikazi, wakati wa kuvuna mtsere? Ela mino ndamvoya Mwenyezi Mlungu arehe mvula na chiguruguru, namwi mundamanya na kuona kukala uyi wenu muriouhenda matsoni pha Mwenyezi Mlungu wa kudzitakira mfalume ni munji sana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Samueli wamvoya Mwenyezi Mlungu, naye Mwenyezi Mlungu achireha mvula na chiguruguru siku hiyo, nao atu osi achimuogopha sana Mwenyezi Mlungu phamwenga na ye Samueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi achimuambira Samueli, “Huvoyere kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlunguo, swiswi atumwao husedze hukafwa mana hukaenjereza dambi zehu zosi kpwa uyi huno wa kudzitakira mfalume.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli wajibu achiamba, “Msiogophe, ni kpweli mwahenda uyi huno wosi, ela msigaluke mkaricha kulunga Mwenyezi Mlungu, badalaye muhumikireni Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa mioyo yenu yosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wala msiuyire kuabudu vizuka, vitu visivyo na fwaida ambavyo taviokola na kutivya mana tavifwaha chitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Mwenyezi Mlungu kandaaricha atue kpwa ajili ya dzinare kulu risiberwe, kpwa kukala ikamfwahira Mwenyezi Mlungu kukuhendani mwimwi mkale atue mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mino sindamuhendera dambi Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa kuricha kukuvoyerani. Nindaenderera kukufundzani njira iriyo nono na ya sawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muogopheni Mwenyezi Mlungu bahi, mukamhumikire kpwa uaminifu na mioyo yenu yosi. Chisha tambukirani vira arivyokuhenderani mambo makulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mchienderera kuhenda mai, mwimwi phamwenga na ye mfalume wenu mundaangamizwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
